homelab-dns (0.1.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Metrics: advertise PowerDNS's native /metrics (pdns-metrics, :8081) for
    homelab-prometheus discovery, and keep the monitoring host in
    webserver-allow-from via a new /etc/homelab/dns/metrics-allow-from that
    homelab-dns-pull-allow-from always merges with the signer set (/metrics
    is allow-from-gated, not api-key-gated).

